      "heading": "What HSE asks for",
      "html": "<p><a href=\"https://www.hse.gov.uk/coshh/faq.htm\">HSE COSHH frequently asked questions</a>: there is no specific form. Employers with five or more employees must record the significant findings, and the record must be available to safety representatives and inspectors. The steps, from <a href=\"https://www.hse.gov.uk/coshh/basics/assessment.htm\">HSE: how to carry out a COSHH risk assessment</a>: identify the hazards, assess the risks, control the risks, inform and train, record, review.</p>"
